    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ea511a0fb36f4e3f00d32d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以把基础锻炼调整得更严苛点吗？\n这也是为了“日本沙土德比”做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa15717d97f6dd613964ee29aa8f67d97b8ca346a8bc417003533b999dc0a7f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
