    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08774384af0b01970d648c69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这下我们终于能够准备迎接──\n“日本沙土德比”这场重要比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8729dd670e19319f8b4de6e457a6068301d4ffe4d8cddc50109af240a4e35095",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
