      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去年年底，\n奇锐骏终于和那位醒目飞鹰\n一起参加了“东京大赏典”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e5f86904cfa6bb36816c28a224c81b304112cb3d68f39311bc9d31dd44a30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
